      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Found a workaround to get the expected response: WSS-Password Type and WSS TimeToLive must be left empty in soapUI. </p>\n\n<p>Response: <br/>\n--------- <br/>\n&lt;soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:xsd=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\"&gt;<br/>\n   &lt;soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;listDatastreamsResponse xmlns=\"http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/types/\"&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;datastreamDef xmlns=\"\"&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;ID&gt;DC&lt;/ID&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;label&gt;Dublin Core Record for this object&lt;/label&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;MIMEType&gt;text/xml&lt;/MIMEType&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;/datastreamDef&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;datastreamDef xmlns=\"\"&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;ID&gt;RELS-EXT&lt;/ID&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;label&gt;RDF Statements about this object&lt;/label&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;MIMEType&gt;application/rdf+xml&lt;/MIMEType&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;/datastreamDef&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;datastreamDef xmlns=\"\"&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;ID&gt;METHODMAP&lt;/ID&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;label&gt;Abstract Method Map&lt;/label&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;MIMEType&gt;text/xml&lt;/MIMEType&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;/datastreamDef&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;/listDatastreamsResponse&gt;<br/>\n   &lt;/soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/soapenv:Envelope&gt;</p>\n",
     "created": "25/Nov/11 12:01 PM",
