  "description": "\n<p>Get 'Did not understand \"MustUnderstand\" header(s)' in the response when calling a Fedora web service with soapUI 4.0.1: </p>\n\n<p>Request: <br/>\n--------<br/>\n&lt;soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:typ=\"http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/types/\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;soapenv:Header&gt;&lt;wsse:Security soapenv:mustUnderstand=\"1\" xmlns:wsse=\"http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-secext-1.0.xsd\"&gt;&lt;wsu:Timestamp wsu:Id=\"Timestamp-75\" xmlns:wsu=\"http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-utility-1.0.xsd\"&gt;&lt;wsu:Created&gt;2011-11-23T16:58:42Z&lt;/wsu:Created&gt;&lt;wsu:Expires&gt;2011-11-23T17:32:02Z&lt;/wsu:Expires&gt;&lt;/wsu:Timestamp&gt;&lt;wsse:UsernameToken wsu:Id=\"UsernameToken-74\" xmlns:wsu=\"http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-utility-1.0.xsd\"&gt;&lt;wsse:Username&gt;xxxxxxxx&lt;/wsse:Username&gt;&lt;wsse:Password Type=\"http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-username-token-profile-1.0#PasswordText\"&gt;xxxxxxxx&lt;/wsse:Password&gt;&lt;wsse:Nonce EncodingType=\"http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-soap-message-security-1.0#Base64Binary\"&gt;w3uon59dmR08T14EovDj3Q==&lt;/wsse:Nonce&gt;&lt;wsu:Created&gt;2011-11-23T16:58:42.843Z&lt;/wsu:Created&gt;&lt;/wsse:UsernameToken&gt;&lt;/wsse:Security&gt;&lt;/soapenv:Header&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>\n       &lt;typ:listDatastreams&gt;<br/>\n          &lt;pid&gt;demo:12&lt;/pid&gt;<br/>\n          &lt;asOfDateTime/&gt;<br/>\n       &lt;/typ:listDatastreams&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;/soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/soapenv:Envelope&gt;</p>\n\n<p>Response: <br/>\n---------<br/>\n&lt;soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:xsd=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\"&gt;<br/>\n   &lt;soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;soapenv:Fault&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;faultcode&gt;soapenv:MustUnderstand&lt;/faultcode&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;faultstring&gt;Did not understand \"MustUnderstand\" header(s):&lt;/faultstring&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;detail&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;ns1:hostname xmlns:ns1=\"http://xml.apache.org/axis/\"&gt;domU-12-31-39-09-F6-32&lt;/ns1:hostname&gt;<br/>\n         &lt;/detail&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;/soapenv:Fault&gt;<br/>\n   &lt;/soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/soapenv:Envelope&gt;</p>\n\n<p>soapUI request format should be supported by Fedora. </p>\n\n<p>Rationale: </p>\n\n<p>soapUI is an easy-to-use tool to quickly create test cases for web services. </p>\n",
